WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:09.150
<b>Did you find out anything?</b>

00:09.480 --> 00:12.610
<b>No, I can't with this jumble
of gazes all around.</b>

00:14.660 --> 00:16.030
<b>What about you, Mr. Tatsuya?</b>

00:16.030 --> 00:20.870
<b>I've checked every single gaze aimed at Miyuki
but didn't detect anything suspicious.</b>

00:21.120 --> 00:22.910
<b>A-All of them?</b>

00:22.910 --> 00:27.630
<b>Yes. As far as scandalous looks go,
she's being bombarded by them,</b>

00:27.630 --> 00:29.130
<b>but the same goes for you, I guess.</b>

00:31.130 --> 00:32.170
<b>Brother...</b>

00:32.510 --> 00:35.380
<b>You shouldn't tease Minoru.</b>

00:39.970 --> 00:42.220
<b>Let's get back to the search.</b>

02:22.910 --> 02:25.200
<b>There are traces of Ancient Magic.</b>

02:25.200 --> 02:26.410
<b>This is...</b>

02:26.410 --> 02:29.290
<b>It looks like they were using familiars
to surveil the area.</b>

02:29.290 --> 02:31.080
<b>They're hidden skillfully.</b>

02:31.670 --> 02:33.380
<b>There are still traces up there.</b>

02:36.840 --> 02:38.420
<b>Welcome!</b>

02:38.420 --> 02:40.430
<b>TOFU</b>

02:44.640 --> 02:46.310
<b>Table for four?</b>

02:46.310 --> 02:47.310
<b>No.</b>

02:49.020 --> 02:50.230
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

02:52.230 --> 02:54.360
<b>Party of four, coming through!</b>

02:52.980 --> 02:56.440
<b><i>I guess we'll get started
after we've had lunch.</i></b>

02:57.070 --> 03:00.320
<b>Two orders of yudofu
and two orders of yuba hot pot, please.</b>

03:00.320 --> 03:01.660
<b>Very well.</b>

03:02.110 --> 03:06.540
<b>Also, I was told about this place
by Mr. Kudou of Ikoma.</b>

03:06.540 --> 03:08.950
<b>Do you think I could meet
with the proprietor?</b>

03:09.210 --> 03:11.580
<b>Mr. Kudou of Ikoma, right?</b>

03:11.580 --> 03:13.500
<b>Understood.</b>

03:20.800 --> 03:26.390
<b>I never thought that I'd get to meet
with someone from the Kudou Family like this.</b>

03:28.220 --> 03:33.270
<b>I no longer have any intention of stirring up
trouble with anyone from Nine.</b>

03:33.520 --> 03:37.270
<b>Forgive me, but aren't you
a member of the Traditionalists?</b>

03:37.690 --> 03:42.150
<b>Yes. I am a conjurer who leads
a branch of the Traditionalists.</b>

03:42.700 --> 03:44.660
<b>How can a Traditionalist magician...</b>

03:44.660 --> 03:49.700
<b>not be hostile toward magicians from the former
Ninth Institute led by the Kudou Family?</b>

03:49.700 --> 03:56.040
<b>Didn't the Traditionalists form because of their
enmity toward the former Ninth Institute?</b>

03:56.840 --> 04:00.970
<b>Initially, we were serious
about plotting our revenge.</b>

04:00.970 --> 04:04.890
<b>But that only concerned
the former Ninth Institute,</b>

04:04.890 --> 04:08.810
<b>and we had no intention
of betraying our homeland.</b>

04:08.810 --> 04:12.980
<b>Are you talking about the fact
that you guys took in the defected immortalists?</b>

04:13.350 --> 04:17.400
<b>We can no longer put up
with the antics of the Nara branch.</b>

04:17.400 --> 04:20.030
<b>Why would they take in
casters from the Continent...</b>

04:20.030 --> 04:23.360
<b>knowing full well they'd turn out
to be traitors within the walls?</b>

04:26.530 --> 04:30.870
<b>Could you show us
that those aren't just empty words?</b>

04:31.120 --> 04:36.330
<b>We're searching for a Chinese magician
who escaped from Yokohama.</b>

04:36.790 --> 04:38.960
<b>His name is Gongjin Zhou.</b>

04:38.960 --> 04:43.260
<b>He's a dangerous man who's brought
numerous disasters upon this country.</b>

04:43.970 --> 04:45.470
<b>Understood.</b>

04:45.470 --> 04:49.140
<b>I'll share the information
that I've managed to obtain.</b>

04:49.560 --> 04:53.270
<b>Gongjin Zhou is not in the city of Kyoto.</b>

04:53.560 --> 04:57.060
<b>The last time we were able to locate him,</b>

04:57.060 --> 05:02.320
<b>he was at the headquarters of a group of former
Esoteric Buddhist priests near the Bamboo Grove.</b>

05:01.150 --> 05:07.620
<b>UJI</b>

05:01.150 --> 05:07.620
<b>KYOTO</b>

05:02.320 --> 05:07.620
<b>After that, he appears to have headed south,
but there's no sign of him having left Uji.</b>

05:07.950 --> 05:14.620
<b>If I'm being honest, I still haven't let go
of my grudge against the former Ninth Institute.</b>

05:15.410 --> 05:20.210
<b>But you people had the decency
to show us the minimum amount of courtesy.</b>

05:20.210 --> 05:23.340
<b>There was no meaningless bloodshed.</b>

05:23.340 --> 05:25.840
<b>Thank you for sharing
such valuable information.</b>

05:26.510 --> 05:27.930
<b>One more thing.</b>

05:27.930 --> 05:31.350
<b>Watch out for the Kuramayama
and Arashiyama factions.</b>

05:31.640 --> 05:36.100
<b>They've been completely duped
by the magicians from the Continent.</b>

05:49.620 --> 05:52.700
<b>The Temple of the Golden Pavilion
didn't yield any clues, either, did it?</b>

05:52.990 --> 05:53.950
<b>No.</b>

05:56.460 --> 05:57.410
<b>Hey!</b>

05:57.410 --> 05:58.460
<b>Ichijo...</b>

05:58.750 --> 05:59.750
<b>Ms...</b>

06:00.420 --> 06:01.670
<b>Shiba!</b>

06:02.460 --> 06:04.170
<b>Long time no see!</b>

06:04.420 --> 06:07.680
<b>So, you're here in Kyoto, too, Ichijo?</b>

06:07.970 --> 06:11.350
<b>Yes. I thought I'd check it out
before next week's Thesis Competition.</b>

06:11.350 --> 06:14.560
<b>He saved us from a pinch, you know!</b>

06:15.270 --> 06:17.270
<b>We learned that the agent...</b>

06:17.270 --> 06:20.900
<b>who guided the Great Asian Alliance
during the Yokohama Disturbance last year...</b>

06:20.900 --> 06:23.820
<b>is being sheltered in the Kyoto area.</b>

06:24.230 --> 06:27.820
<b>I'm here on a mission to find him.</b>

06:27.820 --> 06:30.820
<b>A mission? Shiba, are you...</b>

06:31.320 --> 06:34.700
<b>Not only am I a student at First High School...</b>

06:34.700 --> 06:40.330
<b>I'm also a special officer of the JGDF 101st Brigade
Independent Magic-Equipped Battalion.</b>

06:40.580 --> 06:42.420
<b>What... did you say?!</b>

06:42.420 --> 06:46.800
<b>Ichijo, I know I don't have to tell you this,
but keep this to yourself.</b>

06:46.800 --> 06:47.840
<b>Right.</b>

06:49.760 --> 06:51.390
<b><i>So, this is Tatsuya's technique.</i></b>

06:52.430 --> 06:56.470
<b><i>He drags other people
into his affairs by force like this.</i></b>

06:56.720 --> 06:58.350
<b>Let's get back to the subject.</b>

06:58.350 --> 07:02.560
<b>This agent is an Ancient Magician
who goes by Gongjin Zhou,</b>

07:02.560 --> 07:06.440
<b>and there's a chance that he'll do something
to sabotage the Thesis Competition.</b>

07:06.690 --> 07:08.190
<b>Are you serious?</b>

07:08.570 --> 07:10.490
<b>Ichijo... Do you know something?</b>

07:10.820 --> 07:12.450
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

07:12.450 --> 07:14.740
<b>I see. So, it's him?</b>

07:14.740 --> 07:20.460
<b>It's him, right? During the Yokohama Incident last year,
part of the invasion force fled into Chinatown.</b>

07:21.210 --> 07:25.420
<b>I pressed the residents of Chinatown
to hand them over.</b>

07:25.420 --> 07:27.920
<b>The young guy who'd detained
the invasion force soldiers...</b>

07:27.920 --> 07:32.260
<b>and handed them over to us
announced himself as...</b>

07:32.680 --> 07:34.470
<b>Gongjin Zhou?</b>

07:34.470 --> 07:35.760
<b>That's right.</b>

07:36.100 --> 07:39.100
<b>By the way, what kind of magic
does this guy use?</b>

07:39.100 --> 07:41.480
<b>I hear he uses a spell called "Ghost Walker."</b>

07:41.940 --> 07:44.310
<b>That's a spell used by Ancient Magicians
from the Continent.</b>

07:44.310 --> 07:47.480
<b>It's Sensory Interference Magic
used to disorient the sense of direction.</b>

07:47.820 --> 07:49.150
<b>Direction?</b>

07:49.150 --> 07:53.610
<b>Like, for instance, drowning someone by disorienting
him so he can't tell if he's going up or down?</b>

07:56.490 --> 07:59.120
<b>It's mainly known to be used for...</b>

07:59.450 --> 08:01.910
<b>throwing off your pursuer's
sense of direction,</b>

08:01.910 --> 08:06.250
<b>so that even though you're visible to him,
he'll never catch up to you, no matter what.</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:10.630
<b>Not all of Ghost Walker's sequences
are that large in scale.</b>

08:10.630 --> 08:13.510
<b>Wouldn't they also be effective
on a personal combat level?</b>

08:13.510 --> 08:16.550
<b>I think we should actually be
more wary of that.</b>

08:16.550 --> 08:18.260
<b>What kind of combat, for example?</b>

08:18.560 --> 08:21.810
<b>Casting spells at each other
while at a standstill is one thing...</b>

08:21.810 --> 08:25.400
<b>but if you're both battling
while changing directions at a furious pace,</b>

08:25.400 --> 08:29.400
<b>losing sight of your opponent could lead
to making yourself vulnerable to a fatal degree.</b>

08:29.650 --> 08:32.400
<b>I see. If you're disoriented...</b>

08:32.700 --> 08:35.820
<b>you wouldn't be able to tell
which direction you're facing.</b>

08:35.820 --> 08:37.240
<b>At the same time...</b>

08:37.240 --> 08:42.250
<b>that means you also wouldn't know where
your opponent is from your own standpoint.</b>

08:42.660 --> 08:47.460
<b>Let's set aside the topic of Ghost Walker
for now and discuss today.</b>

08:47.790 --> 08:51.090
<b>Mikihiko, tell us about the enemy you fought.</b>

08:51.550 --> 08:54.930
<b>The enemies who attacked us
were ninjutsu users.</b>

08:55.260 --> 08:57.430
<b>They were probably either ninjas
from Kuramayama...</b>

08:57.430 --> 08:59.310
<b>or ninjas who'd escaped from there.</b>

08:59.310 --> 09:00.060
<b>But...</b>

09:00.470 --> 09:04.390
<b>they were being led
by an immortalist from the Continent.</b>

09:04.690 --> 09:07.230
<b>We made some progress on our end, too.</b>

09:07.230 --> 09:12.900
<b>Not enough to be called a clue, but we were able
to narrow down the range where Gongjin Zhou is hiding.</b>

09:13.360 --> 09:16.660
<b>I'm thinking of going to Arashiyama tomorrow.</b>

09:16.780 --> 09:19.410
<b>OCTOBER 21, A.D. 2096</b>

09:19.830 --> 09:22.410
<b>I'm sorry, Mr. Tatsuya.</b>

09:22.700 --> 09:26.460
<b>Don't give another thought.
It's not as if you're at fault here, Minoru.</b>

09:26.460 --> 09:27.670
<b>Even still...</b>

09:27.670 --> 09:29.790
<b>I'm ashamed of myself.</b>

09:30.090 --> 09:32.000
<b>Don't be so hard on yourself.</b>

09:32.000 --> 09:34.340
<b>You're doing great for us.</b>

09:34.340 --> 09:35.760
<b>You really think so?</b>

09:36.090 --> 09:38.640
<b>That's how I truly feel.</b>

09:39.850 --> 09:42.640
<b>Not only have you been more than helpful...</b>

09:42.970 --> 09:47.100
<b>I'm also sure that when push comes to shove,
I'll be asking for your assistance again.</b>

09:47.100 --> 09:49.520
<b>You need to be ready then,
so don't overdo it now.</b>

09:49.940 --> 09:51.400
<b>All right, I won't.</b>

09:51.730 --> 09:55.150
<b>I'll be leaving Minami with you.
She's an expert at housework.</b>

09:55.490 --> 09:59.660
<b>And just like you,
depending on her would make her happier.</b>

10:00.160 --> 10:03.490
<b>So, ask for anything
no matter how trivial it may be.</b>

10:03.830 --> 10:05.540
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

10:08.120 --> 10:11.380
<b>Minami, sorry. Look after Minoru, will you?</b>

10:11.710 --> 10:13.250
<b>Very well!</b>

10:13.250 --> 10:16.260
<b>I am well aware that this is my job.</b>

10:16.260 --> 10:18.760
<b>Just leave Master Minoru's care to me.</b>

10:26.520 --> 10:30.520
<b>Master Minoru, please rest up well today.</b>

10:30.520 --> 10:33.400
<b>All right. I'll take it easy in bed, then.</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:57.420
<b>Ms. Sakurai, being stared at like that
is embarrassing for me.</b>

11:01.470 --> 11:03.050
<b>I-I'm so sorry!</b>

11:16.440 --> 11:17.610
<b>Shiba...</b>

11:17.610 --> 11:19.530
<b>I thought we were heading to Arashiyama.</b>

11:19.860 --> 11:22.030
<b>Right. But first...</b>

11:29.710 --> 11:32.370
<b>Sorry I'm late, Tatsuya.</b>

11:32.750 --> 11:34.880
<b>No, you're right on time.</b>

11:37.170 --> 11:39.760
<b>These are the clothes
Mr. Nakura was wearing.</b>

11:40.470 --> 11:41.880
<b>And this blood?</b>

11:42.220 --> 11:44.390
<b>These bloodstains are all from the victim.</b>

11:45.260 --> 11:49.180
<b>Mr. Nakura's corpse was found to be pierced
through the stomach from behind,</b>

11:49.180 --> 11:51.640
<b>and his chest had exploded from inside.</b>

11:52.900 --> 11:58.730
<b>Ms. Mayumi, wasn't Mr. Nakura an expert
at casting spells that used liquids?</b>

12:00.440 --> 12:02.570
<b>Oh, right, now I remember!</b>

12:02.570 --> 12:07.620
<b>Mr. Nakura told me his specialty was turning water
into needles and piercing his opponents with them.</b>

12:08.200 --> 12:13.750
<b>If that's the case, did Mr. Nakura turn
his own blood into needles and fire them, maybe?</b>

12:13.750 --> 12:16.880
<b>That's literally counterattacking
at the cost of his life.</b>

12:19.170 --> 12:20.670
<b><i>If Gongjin Zhou's clothes...</i></b>

12:20.670 --> 12:24.430
<b><i>still have any traces of the deceased's blood
on them, it will give us a clue.</i></b>

12:24.430 --> 12:26.260
<b><i>Just in case.</i></b>

12:30.850 --> 12:32.140
<b><i>Thank goodness.</i></b>

12:32.690 --> 12:36.400
<b><i>Master Minoru's condition
seems to be stabilizing now.</i></b>

12:37.860 --> 12:39.780
<b>It's so strange.</b>

12:40.440 --> 12:43.780
<b>Even though I haven't known
Master Minoru for long...</b>

12:44.280 --> 12:48.080
<b>it doesn't feel as if I've met him
for the first time.</b>

12:51.410 --> 12:52.960
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART IV</b>

12:58.250 --> 13:00.210
<b>Is this where it happened?</b>

13:00.590 --> 13:03.840
<b>I'd like to take a look at the surrounding area.
Would that be all right?</b>

13:04.130 --> 13:07.800
<b>Yes. I'm the one who asked you
to come with me after all.</b>

13:07.800 --> 13:12.100
<b>If you have any ideas,
I'll be happy to go along with you.</b>

13:25.490 --> 13:26.360
<b>Brother!</b>

13:35.330 --> 13:37.170
<b><i>Thirteen attackers.</i></b>

13:37.170 --> 13:37.960
<b>Ichijo!</b>

13:37.960 --> 13:38.920
<b>Leave this to me!</b>

13:46.050 --> 13:48.390
<b><i>This noise is similar to Cast Jamming!</i></b>

14:19.290 --> 14:22.250
<b><i>Even if I add the one I just defeated,
that only makes 12.</i></b>

14:22.250 --> 14:23.750
<b><i>There's one missing.</i></b>

14:23.750 --> 14:24.710
<b>Ichijo!</b>

14:24.710 --> 14:26.130
<b>I'll handle this!</b>

14:28.130 --> 14:28.880
<b><i>Kan!</i></b>

14:35.680 --> 14:36.520
<b>What's that?</b>

14:45.690 --> 14:46.490
<b>No way!</b>

14:50.740 --> 14:54.120
<b>Ichijo! Any magic that has
a direct effect will get slashed!</b>

14:56.660 --> 14:59.670
<b><i>Any magic that has a direct effect
will get slashed?</i></b>

15:00.000 --> 15:00.830
<b><i>No.</i></b>

15:01.170 --> 15:04.250
<b><i>My Rupture isn't that lame a spell!</i></b>

15:18.270 --> 15:20.560
<b><i>These magicians are puppets.</i></b>

15:30.070 --> 15:32.660
<b><i>So, that's their headquarters, huh?</i></b>

15:35.660 --> 15:39.910
<b><i>This is an emergency, Mr. Tatsuya! Master Minoru's
health has suddenly taken a turn for the worse!</i></b>

15:39.910 --> 15:41.670
<b>All right. I'll come right back.</b>

15:41.670 --> 15:46.920
<b>I'm going to get in touch with Ms. Fujibayashi,
so keep on looking after him, Minami.</b>

15:46.920 --> 15:50.130
<b>I know it won't be easy for you on your own,
but I'm counting on you.</b>

15:53.760 --> 15:55.970
<b>How's Minoru doing?</b>

15:55.970 --> 15:58.430
<b>The medicine's working, so he's asleep now.</b>

15:58.430 --> 16:01.600
<b>Although he did look like he was
in a lot of anguish just now.</b>

16:03.350 --> 16:06.940
<b>Listen, Tatsuya.
I have a favor to ask of you.</b>

16:06.940 --> 16:08.190
<b>What would that be?</b>

16:08.690 --> 16:11.070
<b>About Minoru's health...</b>

16:11.530 --> 16:14.780
<b>Medically speaking, he has a healthy body.</b>

16:14.780 --> 16:20.700
<b>The doctors have told us they can't figure out
why he's so prone to falling ill.</b>

16:22.830 --> 16:25.540
<b>I... Not just myself...</b>

16:25.540 --> 16:28.840
<b>but also the researchers of the Fujibayashi Clan
are all of the same opinion.</b>

16:28.840 --> 16:33.470
<b>The cause of Minoru's delicate constitution
must lie in his Psion bodies.</b>

16:34.050 --> 16:36.970
<b>And what is that you'd like me to do?</b>

16:37.970 --> 16:40.980
<b>I want you to take a look
at Minoru's Psion bodies.</b>

16:40.980 --> 16:43.230
<b>With your Elemental Sight.</b>

16:46.690 --> 16:48.270
<b>Ms. Fujibayashi...</b>

16:48.270 --> 16:53.450
<b>For me to take that deep a look means
that not only Minoru's physical information,</b>

16:53.450 --> 16:57.990
<b>but also his genetic data
and even the Kudou roots would be revealed.</b>

16:58.280 --> 17:00.370
<b>Do you still want to go through with it?</b>

17:01.250 --> 17:02.370
<b>Please.</b>

17:02.370 --> 17:04.620
<b>I'll take full responsibility.</b>

17:18.890 --> 17:20.180
<b>Brother!</b>

17:20.510 --> 17:21.770
<b>Brother!</b>

17:22.100 --> 17:22.770
<b>Brother!</b>

17:25.020 --> 17:27.900
<b>I'm all right. No need to worry.</b>

17:28.560 --> 17:30.650
<b>Tatsuya, what did you see?</b>

17:37.990 --> 17:40.780
<b>We were attacked at the foot of Ogurayama.</b>

17:40.780 --> 17:43.580
<b>There were 13 attackers in all.</b>

17:43.580 --> 17:48.290
<b>Twelve Esoteric Buddhist Ancient Magicians
and one defected tactician.</b>

17:48.630 --> 17:50.420
<b>We handed them all over to the police.</b>

17:50.420 --> 17:54.670
<b>That's par for the course for you,
Miyuki and the Ichijos' heir apparent.</b>

17:54.670 --> 17:57.550
<b>Even if there'd been ten times as many,
they wouldn't have had a chance.</b>

17:57.930 --> 18:00.640
<b>They weren't that easy to deal with.</b>

18:00.640 --> 18:02.770
<b>Miyuki and Ichijo should get all the credit.</b>

18:02.770 --> 18:05.140
<b>And now, as for what's coming next...</b>

18:05.140 --> 18:09.940
<b>Aren't we going to check out of the hotel today
and return to Tokyo?</b>

18:10.270 --> 18:13.360
<b>I'd like the rest of you
to go back to Tokyo as planned.</b>

18:13.360 --> 18:15.400
<b>I'll be staying one more night.</b>

18:15.400 --> 18:21.080
<b>I plan to go to the police again tomorrow
and ask about the people we caught today.</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:23.450
<b>Brother, in that case, I'll also—</b>

18:23.450 --> 18:26.370
<b>Miyuki, you're the Student Council president.</b>

18:26.370 --> 18:29.120
<b>Being absent from school at this time of year
wouldn't be a good look.</b>

18:30.630 --> 18:32.250
<b>Understood.</b>

18:32.250 --> 18:35.010
<b>KYOTO</b>

18:56.530 --> 19:01.160
<b><i>Because you wouldn't stay with me,
Brother, I was quite anxious.</i></b>

19:01.160 --> 19:02.830
<b>Don't worry.</b>

19:02.830 --> 19:04.660
<b>I was watching you the whole time.</b>

19:04.660 --> 19:07.120
<b>I'd never take my eyes off you.</b>

19:07.750 --> 19:10.170
<b><i>You're right. Forgive me.</i></b>

19:10.500 --> 19:12.540
<b>There's no need to apologize.</b>

19:12.540 --> 19:15.670
<b>I know it was sudden,
and I feel bad about that.</b>

19:15.670 --> 19:18.340
<b>I'll be coming home tomorrow for sure...</b>

19:18.340 --> 19:20.930
<b>so lock up tight tonight and go to bed.</b>

19:21.640 --> 19:23.680
<b>Really, now, Brother...</b>

19:24.010 --> 19:27.390
<b>how old do you think I am?</b>

19:27.390 --> 19:30.810
<b><i>No matter how old you are,
you'll always be my little sister.</i></b>

19:31.440 --> 19:33.440
<b>Yes, you're right!</b>

19:33.440 --> 19:36.820
<b>All right then, I will do
just as I was told by you.</b>

19:36.820 --> 19:40.030
<b>Lock up with extra care and retire to bed.</b>

19:40.030 --> 19:42.490
<b>Good night, Brother.</b>

19:42.820 --> 19:46.290
<b><i>It's a little early but good night.</i></b>

19:54.340 --> 19:55.840
<b><i>So, this is the place?</i></b>

19:56.960 --> 19:58.840
<b><i>No signs of any traps.</i></b>

20:36.670 --> 20:38.300
<b>Optical Camouflage, huh?</b>

20:39.800 --> 20:42.170
<b>Even if you become invisible,
I can still see you.</b>

20:44.680 --> 20:47.560
<b>Why don't you stop wasting my time
and show yourselves?</b>

20:48.890 --> 20:50.890
<b>Restrain him and exorcise him!</b>

21:23.970 --> 21:25.550
<b>Don't do anything unnecessary.</b>

21:25.930 --> 21:28.050
<b>All you have to do
is answer my questions.</b>

21:30.470 --> 21:32.850
<b>Gongjin Zhou was here, wasn't he?</b>

21:32.850 --> 21:35.100
<b>The Chinese magician who fled here...</b>

21:35.100 --> 21:36.940
<b>from the Yokohama Chinatown.</b>

21:37.270 --> 21:38.060
<b>Yes.</b>

21:39.400 --> 21:41.820
<b>Where did Gongjin Zhou say he was going?</b>

21:42.940 --> 21:44.280
<b>To Uji.</b>

21:44.280 --> 21:48.870
<b>He said there was a good place to lie low in
near the Futagozuka Ruins.</b>

21:48.870 --> 21:49.700
<b>All right.</b>

21:50.530 --> 21:51.990
<b>Thanks for your work.</b>

23:36.350 --> 23:39.980
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART V</b>
